    "markdown": "# Envelope API\nAPI whose responses are documented in the {success, payload} envelope (v1)\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost/api`\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [agreement](#agreement)\n\n## agreement\n\n### Is prolongation available\n\n`GET /v1/agreement/available`\n\n**Parameters:**\n\n| Name | Type | Required | Description |\n|------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `uuid` | string | Yes | Agreement |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Fields, the flat way\n\n`GET /v1/agreement/fields`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n\n### Create with explicit responses\n\n`POST /v1/agreement/create`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `uuid` | string | Yes | Agreement |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `201` — ProlongationAvailable\n- `422` — ValidationError\n- `404` — Not found\n\n---\n\n### Nothing documented\n\n`GET /v1/agreement/plain`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n- `default` — Error response\n\n---\n",
    "curl": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Envelope API\nAPI whose responses are documented in the {success, payload} envelope (v1) — cURL examples\n# Auto-generated from OpenAPI spec. Do not edit manually.\n\nBASE_URL=\"http://localhost/api\"\nTOKEN=\"${API_TOKEN:-}\"\n\n# Is prolongation available\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/agreement/available?uuid=\"\n\n# Fields, the flat way\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/agreement/fields\"\n\n# Create with explicit responses\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -d \"uuid=\" \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/agreement/create\"\n\n# Nothing documented\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/agreement/plain\"\n",
